      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have the same issue though I have different specifics on how it affects me.  So long as only one type of object has thousands of instances in the scene Control Panel is \"fine\".\nAs soon as more than one type of object hits those numbers it becomes unresponsive to the point that Unity needs to be force closed.",
